# LinkedIn Job Trend Analysis

## 📊 Project Overview

The LinkedIn Job Trend Analysis project is an interactive Power BI dashboard
designed to analyze job-market trends and opportunities.

The dashboard provides insights into salaries, job roles, cities, companies,
skills, experience levels, and work types.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Analyze the total number of jobs
- Analyze average and highest salaries
- Identify cities with more job opportunities
- Analyze job opportunities by role
- Identify popular skills
- Compare companies based on job openings
- Analyze jobs by experience level
- Analyze different work types

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Excel / CSV
- Data Visualization

## 📈 Dashboard Features

- Total Jobs
- Total Salary
- Average Salary
- Number of Companies
- Highest Salary
- Salary by Role
- Jobs by City
- Jobs by Company
- Jobs by Skill
- Average Salary by Experience Level
- Jobs by Work Type
- Geographical Job Distribution

## 🔍 Interactive Filters

- Job ID
- City
- Company
- Job Title
- Role
- Skill
- Work Type

## 📌 Skills Demonstrated

- Data Cleaning
- Data Transformation
- Data Analysis
- DAX
- Power BI
- Data Visualization
- Business Intelligence

